{"unit_id":"LvienOeria__dsh-launcher#card-zh","repo":"LvienOeria/dsh-launcher","commit":"1502f586e2017ec5f91a360480715999000c42b2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-launcher 是一个供命令行使用的 DSH 插件：安装后提供终端命令来启动 DeepSeek Harness 的 Web 界面。插件在 harness 启动时生成启动脚本和命令包装器，按配置或环境检测结果选择启动方式，轮询本机 Web UI，并可在就绪后打开浏览器。支持自定义命令名、服务地址、启动命令和源码目录，也可将命令目录加入 shell PATH。适合希望从终端快速启动本机 DSH Web 的用户；需要 macOS 或 Linux，以及可用的 DSH 启动方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-25","lib/installer.js:91-140","lib/templates.js:13-57"]}
{"unit_id":"LvienOeria__dsh-launcher#card-en","repo":"LvienOeria/dsh-launcher","commit":"1502f586e2017ec5f91a360480715999000c42b2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-launcher installs a terminal command to start the DSH web UI. It generates a launcher, resolves how to start DSH, polls the local UI, and can open a browser when ready. Configure the command and start method. For macOS or Linux users who want quick terminal access to local DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-25","lib/installer.js:91-140","lib/templates.js:13-57"]}
