{"unit_id":"LvienOeria__dsh-launcher#feature-1","repo":"LvienOeria/dsh-launcher","commit":"1502f586e2017ec5f91a360480715999000c42b2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-launcher 的功能「终端快捷启动」：安装时生成命令包装器和启动脚本。用户运行配置的命令后，脚本启动 DSH 并等待本机 Web UI 响应。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/installer.js:115-140","lib/templates.js:38-57"]}
