{"unit_id":"LvienOeria__dsh-launcher#caveat-1","repo":"LvienOeria/dsh-launcher","commit":"1502f586e2017ec5f91a360480715999000c42b2","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-launcher 使用前须知：仅支持 macOS 和 Linux；其他平台会跳过安装。默认会在用户目录写入启动文件，并可修改 shell 配置以添加 PATH。（见 lib/installer.js:91-98、238-255）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/installer.js:91-98","lib/installer.js:238-255"]}
